Source: keychain-manager
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: AlexMedela <70584290+AlexMedela@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkgconf, libsdl3-dev, libfreetype-dev, libfontconfig-dev, libdbus-1-dev, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/AlexMedela/keychain-manager

Package: keychain-manager
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: gnome-keyring | kwalletmanager | keepassxc
Description: Fast, keyboard-first front end for your desktop's keyrings
 See, search, copy and edit the passwords your apps keep in the desktop keyring (GNOME Keyring, KWallet, KeePassXC
 and other Secret Service providers), with a fast GPU-drawn interface. It stores nothing itself: the keyring
 service keeps the secrets, this is a window onto them.
